  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "控制工程",
    "sub_ename": "CONTROL ENGINEERING",
    "describe_ch": "這課程的目的是呈現控制分析的方法與應用，特別地以個人電腦的幫助，在大學部的層次中，給予學生足夠深度的基本理論。這些理論被設計成用於發展學生思考程序，促使學生達成完整的理解一個大範圍的主題係有關於控制工程，提高對於電機領域的學習動機與興趣。除此之外，基本物理觀念的建立，將是鞏固工程教育的最有價值與永久的部分。本課程亦特別強調各種物理觀念的講述，並輔以數學技巧的說明。期使學生經由簡單理論基礎之理解，進而可以擴展延伸至到新的且複雜的控制系統。",
    "describe_eh": "This course is to present methods of control analysis. The approach is designed to develop students’ thinking process, enabling them to reach a sound understanding of topics related to electrical engineering. The fundamental physical concepts underlie creative engineering and form the most valuable and permanent part of an engineering education. Both theory and modeling are developed from simple beginnings so that they can be readily extended to new and complex control system analysis.",
    "pre_subname": "EEEN2000工程數學(一)、EEEN2001工程數學(二)",
    "pre_sub_id3": "EEEN2000",
    "pre_sub_ename": "EEEN2000 ENGINEERING MATHEMATICS(1)、EEEN2001 ENGINEERING MATHEMATICS(2)",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "能夠描述及推演控制工程理論的基本相關原理。",
      "describe_en": "Describe and derive the basic related theories of control engineering."
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "能理解相關控制工程理論之原理及系統應用。",
      "describe_en": "Understanding the principles of theories of control engineering and its applications in a system."
    },
    {
      "seq": 3,
      "describe_ch": "能運用控制工程理論，並解析應用於控制系統。",
      "describe_en": "Apply control engineering theory to real control systems and can analyze them."
    },
    {
      "seq": 4,
      "describe_ch": "能藉由習題的實作，了解原理及分析控制系統。",
      "describe_en": "Can understand principles of control engineering and analyze elementary control system by solving exercises or doing homework."
    }
  ],
